 "lines": [
  {
   "host": "KEV",
   "text": "It's Fryer Radio, it's week 1, and the oil is hot! I'm Kev!"
  },
  {
   "host": "NIGEL",
   "text": "I'm Nigel. We ran every matchup ten thousand times so you don't have to."
  },
  {
   "host": "KEV",
   "text": "First up, it's Bizzle versus Danna! Bizzle Analytics against the Nilumbik Nets!"
  },
  {
   "host": "NIGEL",
   "text": "Lean Bizzle. 60 percent. Anyone telling you it's over is lying."
  },
  {
   "host": "KEV",
   "text": "Hang on though. Danna is ahead in more categories! 5 to 3!"
  },
  {
   "host": "NIGEL",
   "text": "Correct, and it doesn't matter. Danna's leads are paper thin. Bizzle's leads are real. Quality over quantity, Kev."
  },
  {
   "host": "KEV",
   "text": "The biggest edge on the board? Bizzle in rebounds. 77 percent!"
  },
  {
   "host": "NIGEL",
   "text": "Watch threes. 49 percent to 48 percent. One hot night decides it."
  },
  {
   "host": "KEV",
   "text": "Keep your eyes on Shai Gilgeous-Alexander. 3 games this week and the model rates him the most dangerous man in this matchup!"
  },
  {
   "host": "NIGEL",
   "text": "Best value on the floor: Anthony Davis. 3 dollars. Projected to outproduce guys on ten times the salary."
  },
  {
   "host": "KEV",
   "text": "130 dollars on Nikola Jokic and you get 2 games! The schedule makers have no respect!"
  },
  {
   "host": "NIGEL",
   "text": "Bizzle has 13 games with nowhere to put them. Alexandre Sarr alone has 3 games stuck on the bench. That's the wasted bucket, and it's overflowing."
  },
  {
   "host": "KEV",
   "text": "And he built the model that's telling him this. Physician, heal thyself."
  },
  {
   "host": "NIGEL",
   "text": "Spare a thought for Danna, who loves Cade Cunningham. Bizzle owns him, and he's got 3 games this week."
  },
  {
   "host": "NIGEL",
   "text": "Danna has Walker Kessler, Domantas Sabonis and Brandon Ingram on the sidelines. 35 dollars of cap sitting in the stands."
  },
  {
   "host": "KEV",
   "text": "And Bizzle has already got 2 dollars of dead money on the books before a ball's been bounced!"
  },
  {
   "host": "NIGEL",
   "text": "Free advice for Danna. Pick up Joel Embiid. 4 games, 26.1 points a night. You're welcome."
  },
  {
   "host": "KEV",
   "text": "And game two! Mamba against Slav!"
  },
  {
   "host": "NIGEL",
   "text": "Slav wins this 92 percent of the time. That's not a matchup, that's a hostage situation."
  },
  {
   "host": "KEV",
   "text": "The biggest edge on the board? Slav in points. 98 percent!"
  },
  {
   "host": "NIGEL",
   "text": "The knife-edge is turnovers. 50 percent Mamba, 48 percent Slav. That's where your waiver move goes."
  },
  {
   "host": "KEV",
   "text": "Keep your eyes on Victor Wembanyama. 3 games this week and the model rates him the most dangerous man in this matchup!"
  },
  {
   "host": "NIGEL",
   "text": "Slav is getting Kawhi Leonard for 5 dollars. That's daylight robbery, and I respect it."
  },
  {
   "host": "NIGEL",
   "text": "Mamba has 14 games with nowhere to put them. Darius Garland alone has 2 games stuck on the bench. That's the wasted bucket, and it's overflowing."
  },
  {
   "host": "KEV",
   "text": "And this is the only manager in the league who actually reads the rankings!"
  },
  {
   "host": "NIGEL",
   "text": "Mamba, I'm told you're a big Wembanyama fan. Good news, you'll see plenty of him this week. 3 games. For Slav."
  },
  {
   "host": "NIGEL",
   "text": "Slav has Kon Knueppel on the sidelines. 6 dollars of cap sitting in the stands."
  },
  {
   "host": "NIGEL",
   "text": "If Mamba wants a lifeline: Rudy Gobert is sitting on waivers. 3 games, about 11.4 rebounds a game."
  },
  {
   "host": "KEV",
   "text": "Nigel. Lock of the week."
  },
  {
   "host": "NIGEL",
   "text": "Slav. 92 percent. Write it in pen."
  },
  {
   "host": "KEV",
   "text": "Upset alert?"
  },
  {
   "host": "NIGEL",
   "text": "Danna at 37 percent. That's not nothing."
  },
  {
   "host": "KEV",
   "text": "Lineups lock with the first game of the day! Don't be the guy with a star on the bench! See you after the final whistle!"
  }
